        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Olivia Munn, Johnny Depp, Gwyneth Paltrow, Ewan McGregor, Paul Bettany, Jeff Goldblum, Alec Utgoff, Bryan Singer, Simon Kinberg, Michael Dougherty, Dan Harris, James McAvoy, Michael Fassbender, Jennifer Lawrence, Oscar Isaac, Nicholas Hoult, Rose Byrne, Tye Sheridan, Sophie Turner, Lucas Till\n- Films: Mortdecai, X-Men: Apocalypse, San Andreas\n- Roles: Lisa Olivia Munn, Dmitri, Aleksandr Borovsky, Alexi\n\nFacts:\n- Olivia Munn was born on July 3, 1980, and she is an American actress and model.\n- Alec Utgoff played Aleksandr Borovsky in a 2014 production.\n- The 2015 film Mortdecai stars Johnny Depp in the title role and also features Gwyneth Paltrow, Ewan McGregor, Olivia Munn, Paul Bettany, and Jeff Goldblum.\n- Alec Utgoff played Dmitri in the 2015 film Mortdecai.\n- Alec Utgoff played Alexi in the 2015 film San Andreas.\n- X-Men: Apocalypse was directed by Bryan Singer, and its screenplay was written by Simon Kinberg from a story conceived by Bryan Singer, Simon Kinberg, Michael Dougherty, and Dan Harris.\n- X-Men: Apocalypse stars James McAvoy, Michael Fassbender, Jennifer Lawrence, Oscar Isaac, Nicholas Hoult, Rose Byrne, Tye Sheridan, Sophie Turner, Olivia Munn, and Lucas Till.",
